{
  "title": "Skyline Pulse — Database & Site Activity",
  "description": "Production D1 rolling activity, query latency, storage, collector heartbeat and existing Cloudflare zone traffic. D1 charts require the two collector secrets; blank charts do not mean zero usage.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3
      },
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "has_padding": true,
        "content": "## Skyline Pulse — Database & Site Activity\n[Cloudflare D1 activity](https://dash.cloudflare.com/87d75a85659dd39b348acf458b75b606/workers/d1/databases/ebaf7a80-ec0c-430c-a782-bae2cd427cb2/metrics) · [Pulse](https://skylinechurch.tech) · [Collector settings](https://dash.cloudflare.com/87d75a85659dd39b348acf458b75b606/workers/services/view/skyline-pulse-d1-metrics/production/settings)\nDatabase metrics refresh every 5 minutes after both collector secrets are configured. Counts are **rolling 15-minute gauges**, delayed 5 minutes for analytics ingestion; do not sum successive points. A blank graph means no fresh telemetry, not zero activity. Site traffic includes Cloudflare Access login redirects and is separate from database queries."
      }
    },
    {
      "layout": {
        "width": 3,
        "height": 2
      },
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Read queries · last 15m",
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 2,
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "value",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "avg:skyline.pulse.d1.read_queries_15m{service:skyline-pulse,env:production,database:skyline-pulse-production}.fill(null)",
                "aggregator": "last"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
